on: This move consolidates the lowest cards in the hand efficiently. By playing the Full House 444+33, you reduce the total number of turns needed to empty your hand compared to playing a naked airplane and being left with isolated low pairs. It sets up a follow-up of 555+66 and leaves the strong pair sequence and high cards to control the endgame.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣3", "♦3", "♥4", "♣4", "♦4"]}'}
